            "review_title": "Review at Coco's Surf Kitchen Lounge",
            "review_text": "IceOleg\nМосква, Россия36 contributions\n0\nSuch a disappointment for a loyal customer\nOct 2020 • Family\nI’ve been a client of this place for over 8 years. Several owners have changed since the first time I’ve been there, my daughter celebrated her birthday there. I mean that I love this place and was a loyal long term customer. Just imagine how disappointed I was when I came there today with my family to find out that the owner is in a bad mood and inventively rude to us. She had no customers at all, but didn’t want to to move the chairs, order food or drinks because she was working alone and No one help her... after over 100 visits!!!\nWhat can I say? Good luck with your business...\nRead more\nWritten October 24, 2020",
