            "review_title": "Review at Coco's Surf Kitchen Lounge",
            "review_text": "Archie37\nLondon, United Kingdom19 contributions\n0\nWonderful bar on a lovely stretch of beach\nAug 2019\nCoco's Surf Kitchen (named after the owners adorable little dog) is a great place to chill out on the beach. The atmosphere is very laid back and friendly - the owner Trinni is amazing and will take good care of you. Delicious home cooked food and nice cold beer to wash is down with, what more could you want...\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 16, 2019\nTrinni\nThank you for your review and we are glad to know you enjoy your time at our bar. \nGreat regards \nTrinni\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
