            "review_title": "Review at Coco's Surf Kitchen Lounge",
            "review_text": "Kate P\nEssex, United Kingdom9 contributions\n3\nDisappointing!\nAug 2019 • Family\nWe stumbled across this place when visiting the beach for the day & on the face of it, thought we’d found a pretty cool place to have drinks & lunch! However, we waited way too long for our food (an hour & a half) with 2 hungry kids, but remained positive & hoped it would be worth the wait!!! It wasn’t! It was very basic & what we thought were Vietnamese dishes, didn’t have the authentic flavours of Vietnamese food! There wasn’t any real sort of apology for the wait either.....so disappointed...\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 7, 2019\nTrinni\nHi there, thanks for taking the time to write a review about your experience at coco’s . We’re sorry to hear that you didn’t have good time at our bar and we are so apologize for any reason make you feel unsatisfied. We will Learn from your feedback and work with the team looking at improving our service as good as possible and every feedback from customers are supporting us a lot. \nThank you for your sharing \nKind Regards \nTrinni\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
