            "review_text": "Giles5\nVung Tau, Vietnam54 contributions\n0\nAmazing place so chilled out\nJun 2019 • Friends\nWe come down a couple of times a week definitely worth the 20 min scooter ride from central NHA Trang. Great menu best burgers and snack dishes, also great seafood priced competitively. Golden sand clean beach Chrystal clear waters. You can also hire paddle boards surfboards and inflatables. There is also a local expat/Viet taxi firm that does a great price for a return trip should you want to go as a group, easy to find on Facebook (NHA Trang private hire) all in all definitely the best beach bar around.\nRead more\nWritten June 12, 2019\nTrinni\nThanks for your sharing\nWritten September 17, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
